# Phase 2 readout (auto-generated by src/phase2_analyze.py)

Environment pair: control = NC, disclosure = NDA (variant A). Headline models: glm-5.3-flash, qwen3.8-27b, deepseek-v4-flash, gemma-4-26b-a4b. Ceiling models: none.
Episodes: 240 of 240 expected. Bootstrap resamples: 2000. Tests: two-sided Wald tests on the GEE coefficient; effects are percentage points (treat minus reference).


